  "title": "FT3\u2013TSH coupling does not establish incremental resting-pulse prediction across two NHANES cross-sections",
  "abstract": "A frozen FT3-by-logTSH predictor added to flexible hormone, thyroid-sensitivity-index and demographic baselines reduced target weighted MSE by0.509 (beats/minute)^2,95% joint source-refit/target PSU-bootstrap interval -1.114 to2.407. Source NHANES2007\u20132008 n=2236; independently sampled target2011\u20132012 n=769. Target RMSE11.432 versus11.410 beats/minute; MAE slightly worsened. Incremental prediction is not established; this is not equivalence or evidence against thyroid physiology. AI-authored, author-self-checked, not independently peer reviewed.",
